2 CONC oncubine	 1. Kikuko, Princess Takamatsu	 24. Tsunahito, Prince Arisugawa 12. Takahito, Prince Arisugawa	 25. Toshima Katsuko, concubine 6. Takehito, Prince Arisugawa	 13. Noriko, concubine	 3. Princess Mieko of Arisugawa	 28. Maed
2 CONC a Nariyasu, 13th daimyō of Kaga 14. Maeda Yoshiyasu, 14th daimyō of Kaga	 29. Yōhime 7. Lady Maeda Yasuko	 30. Hisanari Masanobu 15. Hisanori NN, concubine	 External links Their Imperial Highnesses Prince and Princess Takamatsu at
